# Vue Version Rule

All Vue-related dependencies must use Vue 2.6.x to ensure compatibility and consistent behavior across the project.

## Requirements

Name: "Vue Framework Version"
Pattern: \.(vue|js)$
Description: "Project uses Vue.js 2.6.12, Vue Router 3.5.1, and Vuex 3.6.2"
Framework Versions:
  vue: 2.6.12
  vue-router: 3.5.1
  vuex: 3.6.2
Severity: Info

